  "concept": {
    "zh": "三条固定巡线 · 双电池撤离",
    "en": "Three fixed patrols · Two-battery escape"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "28 回合内取走两块电池并撤离。三台对手沿自己的路线循环，石墨号每 4 回合往返一次，铜线号的巡线共 6 回合，梭巡号每 4 回合回到原位。和对手同格或迎面换位会被抓。从容模式下，同一份程序须通过 2 张地图。",
    "en": "Collect both batteries and escape in 28 turns. The three rivals follow repeating patrols. Graphite and Shuttle loop every four turns. Copperwire repeats every six turns. Sharing a tile or swapping positions head-on with a rival gets you caught. In Relaxed mode, one program must win on all 2 maps."
  },
